<title>USA: Omaha cattle off $2.00/3.00 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha cattle off $2.00/3.00 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade on slaughter steers and heifers rather slow, said the USDA. Prices were $2.00/3.00 lower than last week.</p>
<p>Slaughter Steers: Choice 2-4, 1100-1350 lbs 65.50-66.50.</p>
<p>Slaughter Heifers: Choice 2-4, 1050-1250 lbs 65.50-66.50.</p>
</text>
